OL,3,GNEWSASearch halted after reports of
OL,4,Aperson swept out to sea in Largs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coastguard has halted its search
OL,7,Ffor a person reportedly swept out to
OL,8,Fsea in Ayrshire during stormy weather.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called out to
OL,11,Fan area around Burnlea Road in Largs at
OL,12,Fabout 00:10, after large waves struck
OL,13,Fthe coast.
OL,15,FThe coastguard confirmed that a
OL,16,Fhelicopter and aeroplane were sent in
OL,17,Fresponse, as well as rescue teams from
OL,18,FLargs and Ardrossan, and RNLI lifeboats
OL,19,Ffrom Largs and Troon.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
