OL,3,GNEWSASearch halted after reports of
OL,4,Aperson swept out to sea in Largs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said no-one was found
OL,7,Fafter an extensive search and searches
OL,8,Fwere suspended at about 09:00, pending
OL,9,Fany new information.
